{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/I90c35MwUNW0uE8KsLhW3Q","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:43.631293+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/I90c35MwUNW0uE8KsLhW3Q","html":"<div><p><span><span>清华大学精密仪器系</span></span><span><strong><span><span><span>拟于2025年7月初举办“精仪之光，紫荆花开”优秀大学生夏令营</span></span></span></strong><span><span>，旨在为应届学子提供近距离感受清华、认识精仪的机会，传承与发扬“精益求精，止于至善”的清华精仪文化，促进高校优秀大学生的互动交流，增强科研兴趣，拓展学术视野，了解研究方向。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>夏令营的主要内容包括：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1. 介绍清华大学精密仪器系的总体情况。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 科研方向、科研团队学术交流。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/o9P72uH3DaSVYSgbia5iarn1iarjsgib9cdnjhAcR2JqiczqqpO2P0lLe4vxUvoZa7EpGgK2pFyQV0RaksRjwMhhFVQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></p></section><section><p><strong><span><span>1. </span></span></strong><span><span>对清华大学精仪系仪器科学与技术/光学工程研究方向有浓厚兴趣的国内外重点高校2026届本科毕业生或硕士毕业生。</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2. </span></span></strong><span><span>所学专业包括但不限于测控技术与仪器、光电信息工程、光电子、机电工程、机械工程、自动化、物理。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>3. </span></span></strong><span><span>学习成绩一贯优秀，本科生要求前三年成绩综合排名在本专业前10％或前5名；综合素质发展方面有突出表现的学生，其成绩综合排名可以适当放宽。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>4. </span></span></strong><span><span>英语水平优良。</span></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请材料</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section><section><p><strong><span>必需材料：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>1. </span></span></strong><span><span>夏令营申请表和信息采集表</span></span><span><span>（点击文末阅读原文获取）。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2. </span></span></strong><span><span>本科成绩单和学习成绩排名证明（如无特殊情况，需由教务部门盖章）。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>其他材料（可根据自身情况选择提交）：</span></strong></p><p><span><span>能体现自身科研水平的代表性学术成果的复印件、获奖证书复印件、英语四、六级证书复印件等。</span></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>三、报名和入营</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section><p><span><span>申请人于2025年6月9日下午5点前，按拟申报学科，通过夏令营对应联系邮箱（</span></span><span><span><span><strong><span>见最后“咨询联系”部分</span></strong></span><span>）提交夏令营申请表、信息采集表和其它关键证明材料电子版。建议将</span></span><span><span>所有文件打包为一个ZIP或RAR文件，文件小于10MB，文件命名方式为“大学-院系-个人姓名”，如“清华大学精密仪器系张三”。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>夏令营申请表、信息采集表的电子版可通过点击文末“阅读原文”获取，也可在清华大学精密仪器系的网站主页</span></span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>http://www.dpi.tsinghua.edu.cn</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>上下载</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>夏令营入营资格和通知工作将于6月17日下午5点前结束，组委会将直接电话或E-Mail通知本人。未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>四、注意事项</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>1. </span></span></strong></span><span><strong><span><span>报名截止日期为6月9日下午5点，逾期不再接受申请。</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>2. </span><span><span>入营</span></span></span></strong></span><strong><span><span>通知截止日期为6月17日下午5点。</span></span></strong><span><span>未入选者，不另行通知。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>3. </span></span></strong><span><span>学员需对提交材料的真实性负责，不得弄虚作假。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>4. </span></span></strong><span><span>如受政策或条件影响导致夏令营工作安排或信息变化的，我系将做相应调整，最终以我系发布的相关通知为准。</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/o9P72uH3DaSVYSgbia5iarn1iarjsgib9cdn6p2HBPccuNbnIF9zqBmeUDr59KuhYaamQyrTfxFuNbZqX6lGZOz36g/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>咨询联系</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><strong><span>仪器科学与技术：</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>李黄龙 副教授</span></span></p><p><span><span>email：</span></span></p><p><span><span>2025summercamp_dpi@tsinghua.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>光学工程：</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>付星 副教授</span></span></p><p><span><span>email：</span></span></p><p><span><span>oe@mail.tsinghua.edu.cn</span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>点击下方“阅读原文”获取夏令营申请表和信息采集表</span></span></p></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/o9P72uH3DaQTafWjdLrQGxeicMPzlCmAGNkAe6CHlzk8GweQXpL9K4x0R93tvgyhAA9mdd5HWHlftianbUg8hMdA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"bd0f397e2431284b19078b938b0d138995b95e896dd8253b6627d6f7d48cd8db","textLength":1048,"sourceSha256":"749ea46b5a0ee2ec10b646ad169ca2cfbc788c96ec869c67500bd286b7c77c39","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d9bbf5aa43bdb6d93920","title":"2025清华大学精密仪器系“精仪之光，紫荆花开”优秀大学生暑期夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:43.631293+00:00"}
